# Copy to deployments/.env (NOT the repo root — docker compose loads the
# .env next to the compose file it was invoked with `-f`, not the one in
# the directory you ran the command from; the repo root .env.example is a
# separate file for native `go run ./cmd/promogo`, not read by compose at
# all). Never commit deployments/.env.
#
# Fills the app service's environment in docker-compose.yml. Empty disables
# staff OIDC login, same as configs/config.yaml's own default.
#
# To test against the local mock issuer (make oidc-mock-up, see
# ../web/admin/README.md "Local OIDC for dev"):
# PROMOGO_OIDC_ISSUER_URL=http://localhost:8091/default
# PROMOGO_OIDC_AUDIENCE=promogo-admin-web
# PROMOGO_OIDC_JWKS_URL=http://oidc-mock:8080/default/jwks   (app reaches
#   oidc-mock over the compose network; a browser never calls this URL)
PROMOGO_OIDC_ISSUER_URL=
PROMOGO_OIDC_AUDIENCE=
PROMOGO_OIDC_JWKS_URL=
